ps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2603300/extras/e50b599f2b83f0be6d7a3a75bc70ea43.webp?t=1742582996\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live historical confrontations and forge new paths  with two full campaigns to choose from, featuring battles and historical figures from a war that lasted two decades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the intensity of decision-making and its impact on combat and history. In-battle missions are a real challenge, where objectives can change in the blink of an eye. Prepare to adapt and make crucial strategic decisions in real-time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy for everyone, from beginners to veterans. Immerse yourself in a strategic combat system that perfectly balances tactical depth with universal accessibility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a complete combat system based on positioning, flanking, and covering as you face challenging scenarios, from dense forests to ancient cities and majestic mountains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each battle, your units will evolve, improving their skills and acquiring new ones to strengthen your army. Outside the battlefield, wisely manage your resources to upgrade your troops' equipment\u2014key to surviving one more day of war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use every resource at your disposal to defeat armies bigger than your own; in &quot;Songs of Steel: Hispania&quot;, your strategic skill is the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet historical figures such as Rhetogenes, Scipio, Megara, Ambo and  Leuco with hand-drawn illustrations that capture the beauty and brutality of that era.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your skill and decisions will mark the fate of your people!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class